<title>USA: Illinois River grain barge prices - June 13.</title>
<headline>Illinois River grain barge prices - June 13.</headline>
<text>
<p>Illinois River barge loading terminals bids to producers (dollar/bu)</p>
<p>				    South of Peoria	    change (cents/bu)</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.71-2.74		up 1-2</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 8.45-8.50		up 5-6</p>
<p>			  Contract bids for Fall delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.43-2.47		mixed</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Soybeans		 6.67-6.72		up 2-3</p>
<p>US 2 Soft Wheat **		   3.40-3.45		mixed</p>
<p>				   North of Peoria</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.71-2.74		up 1</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 8.50-8.52		up 5-7</p>
<p>			    Contract bids for Fall delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.44-2.46		unch to dn 1</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 6.69-6.71		up 1-2</p>
<p>US 2 Soft Wheat **		   3.43-3.46		mixed</p>
<p>**June-July Delivery (Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
